This is crucial.
________________________________________
Step 3 — Establish new leadership
Suppose R1 wins:
R1 = new primary
R2 = replica
________________________________________
Step 4 — Increment leadership term
Old term = 10
New term = 11
________________________________________
Step 5 — Redirect clients
Client
   |
   v
R1
