75. Your mental model going forward
For every distributed database operation, mentally execute:
                REQUEST
                   |
                   v
            Which node receives it?
                   |
                   v
             Is it durable?
                   |
                   v
             Is it committed?
                   |
                   v
          Which replicas have it?
                   |
                   v
             Client gets ACK
                   |
                   v
          Where can next READ go?
                   |
