20. Cross-region RPO
Suppose:
US Primary
EU Replica
and replication lag is:
3 seconds
US region completely disappears.
Potentially:
last 3 seconds of committed data
may not exist in EU.
So:
RPO ≈ replication lag
conceptually.
This directly connects:
replication lag
        ↓
disaster recovery
        ↓
RPO
