Don't solve this yet—we'll spend an entire lesson on it.
For now, understand the problem.
Before failure:
             Leader
             LSN=500
             /     \
            v       v
        F1=500    F2=499
Leader crashes.
             💀 Leader
              X
             / \
            v   v
         F1=500 F2=499
Who becomes leader?
Can F2 become leader?
What happens to operation #500?
Can a stale follower become leader?
Can two followers both think they're leader?
These questions lead directly into:
Lesson 4 — Leader Failure + Election
and:
Lesson 5 — Split Brain + Failover
