45. Final cheat sheet
Concept	Core question
Heartbeat	Is the leader apparently reachable?
Timeout	When should we suspect failure?
Election	Who should become leader?
Term/Epoch	Which leadership generation is newer?
Quorum	Does this side have enough authority?
Log freshness	Is this candidate sufficiently up-to-date?
Commit	Which operations are authoritative?
Fencing	Can stale leadership physically perform operations?
Failover	How do we move service to the new leader?
Retry	What happens when clients don't know whether a request succeeded?
Idempotency	How do we safely retry ambiguous operations?
Split brain	Can multiple sides independently exercise conflicting authority?
