Concept	Main purpose
synchronized / ReentrantLock	Threads in one JVM
Database transaction	Atomic state changes
Distributed lock	Coordinate ownership across processes
Lease / TTL	Recover from dead owners
Unique lock token	Prevent stale release
Fencing token	Prevent stale owner from modifying resource
Idempotency key	Safely retry an operation
Version / CAS	Detect conflicting state changes
Consensus / quorum	Establish authoritative distributed state
Epoch / term / generation	Identify current authority
